{"unit_id":"elio040208__paper2agent-dsh#card-zh","repo":"elio040208/paper2agent-dsh","commit":"6025b0d7df1232de37f8e06464d49d76b3ca3fef","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"paper2agent-dsh（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：将科研论文和代码仓库整理为可安装的 DeepSeek Harness Cordis 工具包。它通过多个 Cordis 模块接入 DSH，扫描输入文件与代码仓库、识别常见运行时并提出可调用能力，再根据经过审核且绑定命令的能力生成 bundle，并检查生成文件和 bundle 声明。适合希望把已有研究代码包装为模型可调用命令的开发者。需要 Node.js 22.19 或更新版本；提取 PDF 还需要 pdftotext。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/orchestrator.js:10-34","plugins/tool-api.js:8-44","plugins/bundle-generator.js:10-19","plugins/bundle-verifier.js:8-21","plugins/paper-extractor.js:13-17"]}
